{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_flower_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_flower_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"改建計畫","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_flower_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"22c667721aefe7f9e4a834e12165819013e37f973a52bb13a87321a994c921b7","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"个人剧情 调香师"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"清晨\n羅德島宿舍區\n調香師的宿舍"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（這樣的話空間就足夠了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（產量上......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（這一塊，可能需要調整栽培方式。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（還有這裡......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萊娜姐姐，我來給您送報告啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？是波登可嗎，請進吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好，萊娜姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好，波登可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"這是您委託製作的庫存清單和訂單整理表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（庫存數字都對得上。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（訂單資訊也很清晰，附上的預算......也沒什麼問題呢。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（一些問題很明瞭了，不知道她能不能發現。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多資料都交給你一個人做，真是辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"比起照料花卉，這些還是很簡單的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（發現了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"最近的訂單和預約越來越多了......活多一些沒什麼，晚睡一會還可以應付過去，可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"原料不夠了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，庭院裡花卉的產量已經完全跟不上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"要是再按現在的速度消耗下去，一個月以後我們就沒有鮮花給大家做東西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的話，我想申請採購一些花卉，這樣可以在想出辦法之前爭取點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐您覺得合適嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，怎麼樣比較好呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你怎麼還一副沒事的樣子，花要不夠用了呀？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，別急嘛，總能想到辦法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"來，坐吧，喝杯茶，休息一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"正好我有幾個問題想諮詢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"既然姐姐您都這樣說了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我問你，羅德島常年在整個大地上四處移動，你有穩定的供應商為你供貨嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"拜託後勤部的話，他們應該能想到辦法吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"那也不能事事都麻煩他們，總有更重要的東西需要他們尋找管道和花費資金，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"如果後勤部的幹員們幫忙聯繫到了供應商，但對方不能滿足我們的需求，這下又怎麼辦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"要知道庭院裡的花可是我們辛苦從全泰拉收集過來的，某些甚至是不被允許交易的特有花卉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們下了訂單，對方沒法滿足我們的需求，那又怎麼辦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們可以只買常見花卉，把空間空出來，全部種植珍稀花朵呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"比方說玫瑰，您覺得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（噗，是我以前想過的蠢辦法呢。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦，這是我們用量最大，也是最容易購買到的花朵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"波登可，還記得自己在家鄉種的玫瑰花嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"那你覺得，家鄉的玫瑰花和庭院裡種植的玫瑰花，有什麼區別呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"家裡的玫瑰花氣味比較清淡，與其說像花，不如說像我們當地的一種水果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐這裡的玫瑰，香味很濃，卻又不衝鼻子，很好聞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，同樣是玫瑰，差別卻有那麼大。我們又怎麼確定供應商送來的花朵，和我們自己栽種的，是同樣品質的花朵呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我們固然是可以將這些花當作自己栽種的花來用，可萬一有幹員因為原料的細微變化在服用我們的製品後不適，我可就對不起博士的信任了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，即使是玫瑰，有些品種也不容易買到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得長在冰箱冷凍櫃裡的玫瑰嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"那些雖然也是玫瑰，但性質，尤其是藥用性質上和田裡種植的玫瑰有很大差別，因為只在烏薩斯以北的冰原生長，是醫療部特意委託我種植的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我總不能，隨便凍一支玫瑰就交給凱爾希醫生吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉姐姐，是我沒想到這些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經考慮了許多，很不錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"萊娜姐姐，你這麼說肯定是想好主意了，告訴我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦呢~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"那就乾脆把療養庭院關掉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"萊娜姐姐你可別想不開呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是一直很清醒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"湊近一些，看看這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"這是——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"療養庭院的改造計劃書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經和博士討論過了，他同意把庭院旁邊的倉庫清空，全部劃歸給庭院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣庭院有了更多的栽植空間，提供給客人的休閒區、進行香薰療法的香薰室、你的小溫室都可以進行相應的改修。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"我的也可以擴大嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我也準備把自己的宿舍搬進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐要住在庭院裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"因為從宿舍去庭院太費時間了，所以我想，乾脆就住在庭院裡比較好，一部分研究室也可以順帶合併到我的宿舍裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣一算，反而能節省不少空間呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"只是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"只是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只有我們來幹，人手上還是太緊張了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"正巧我們有更多的空間來建造個大型溫室，能麻煩你幫我找一位這樣的幹員過來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"要求是擅長栽種和擅長建造溫室，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先去找人了，找到了就聯繫姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，路上小心啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，這孩子也慢慢成長起來了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"或許這一回，我能只監督不做工了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希小姐也真是的，當初和她發牢騷說花卉品質不好，直接就把整個療養庭院丟給我負責了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"規劃、計量、栽培，還真是什麼麻煩事都交給我一個人辦了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我也，唉......就那麼聽她的話自己一邊學一邊建......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"還好能種出些花，能夠給羅德島的各位一個交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這次就讓波登可也鍛煉一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我呢，就把事情安排好，然後坐在旁邊給自己放個小長假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"喝杯茶休息一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"茶包......茶包......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"中午\n羅德島宿舍區\n調香師的宿舍"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（這裡應該用不著再修改了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（有些餓了啊。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"今天吃什麼好呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像已經聞到食物的香味了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，這是——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅嗅）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"這個花香，我怎麼從沒在島上聞到過？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"就通融一點——點，一小塊場地，就可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"我家的小磐蟹最近開始長個了，新生代好像也快要誕生了，為了新的小生命，就幫忙批一些空間吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"如果養殖場空間不夠的話，我真的會養在宿舍裡的，雖然它們不會亂走動，但宿管姐姐們肯定會不開心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你這個人做事就不能靈活些嗎！唉，不和你說了，我找其他人去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像遇上了些事情，有什麼我能幫上忙的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"啊你好，你是——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我是調香師萊娜，負責管理療養庭院和照料花朵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"你好萊娜，我是豆苗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是飯點了，方便的話可以一起用餐嗎，這樣我們可以邊吃邊聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，就這樣吧，我正巧也有點餓了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，你的特長是養殖磐蟹，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"是呀，這些都是好寶貝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"和那些野生的磐蟹不一樣，它們又溫馴又聽話，有的還特別黏人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"比如說豆豆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆豆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（眨眨眼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以，摸摸它嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"可以呀，豆豆不怕生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（完全沒有攻擊性呢。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個香味，的確是從磐蟹頭頂的花上傳來的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（我之前從來沒聞過，或許是種稀有花卉？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（不濃郁，但是很耐聞，香氣也很穩固。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（或許會是不錯的底香。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（藥用價值的話，還需要等採集以後進行更進一步的分析。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"萊娜小姐，您突然就呆在那裡了，想什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，真是抱歉，職業病犯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"豆豆身上的味道，很好聞呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？能聽到專家這麼說真是太好啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"能冒昧打聽一下，豆豆頭上的花，可以採摘下來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"可以哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"它們互相玩耍的時候有時也會把花剪下來或者吃掉，但很快就長出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（是一種穩定共生的花卉嗎？真有趣。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（或許我可以試著請豆苗幫我“種”一些？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（之前就想在庭院裡養些溫馴的動物，可惜沒能找到合適的品種。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（這一次或許是個機會。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你能聽聽我的請求嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我對這些小傢伙頭上的花卉很有興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"這些花非常獨特，我只在它們頭上見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"如果開發出特定用途的話，一定會是非常珍貴的材料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛恰巧聽到了你和後勤幹員的談話。你也在頭疼養殖區域的問題，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我可以給你一些空間來安置小傢伙們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"真的哦，這件事如果成功了，想必對大家都有好處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"只要這些小傢伙能夠乖乖被養起來，不在溫室裡亂跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"適當的時候和來庭院的幹員們互動一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"它們都是我親手養大的，對人沒什麼敵意，你可以放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"有你擔保，我可就安心多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"合約的話，就麻煩由你這邊起草了，相關的費用和金額我們可以到時候再詳談。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘀嘀嘀——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，是我的終端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"你找到人了嗎？好，好的，辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在就過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"好，一會見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"嘀嘀"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，豆苗，我還有些事，就先離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"這個是我的名片，如果你合約準備好了，可以隨時聯繫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，萊娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豆苗","speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您，您真是個好人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"好人哪裡都是，知心大姐姐只有這裡一個哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"下次再見~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅德島本艦\n療養庭院前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我在這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"波登可，你找的幹員呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼只看見——一輛小型拖拉機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛小姐在拖拉機後面，馬上就過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛小姐，風笛小姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！你來了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，調香師！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"我幫波登可搬了一些土過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"已經按照最合適的比例配比好了，我能立刻開工哦，就等你開門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"有些土我看顆粒太大就給它磨細，這樣混合起來會方便些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（她把火山岩給，磨細了？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"萊娜姐姐你怎麼了？臉色好像不太好，是身體不舒服嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛，能麻煩你一件事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你說，有什麼能幫的我一定幫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"那就請幫我把混起來的土分開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"您，混，錯，了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起！真的對不起！我以為你種花的土是混合好以後直接撒在大棚裡的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，不要生氣了，我、我也沒意識到，不好意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（算了，也不能怪她們，畢竟我做過更傻的事情......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（那時候我可是開著工程車腳踩油門一路撞到食堂去了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（這位是風笛小姐吧，她確實很熟悉農業，應該能幫得上忙。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（請她幫忙吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（等我說完這幾句氣話。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛小姐，下次請不要再開這樣的玩笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我沒有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"在庭院裡種花和在種植區種菜還是不一樣的，我們不是在一個有限空間裡種植大量同種類作物，請你理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嗚......是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"這些土種不了花，到時候拿去做養殖場的基底吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"養殖場？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，改建計畫上有些改動，我需要養殖一些豆苗小姐的小磐蟹，詳細情況我們回去再談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不需要我的話，我就先回去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好的，先把拖拉機開走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟今天還沒開工，用不上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"混合土也存放在你那裡吧，這裡暫時沒有空間堆存了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"等做完之後，請來一趟我的宿舍吧，還有許多事要勞煩你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"我還可以，繼續幫忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"不生我的氣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"生氣啊，當然生氣呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"但是生氣也得做事情啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說你不準備幫我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚娜娜你真是個好人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的話，請叫我萊娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"娜娜聽起來更可愛一點嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"今天還有很多工作要做呢，我們先回去吧，波登可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"請快一些哦，風笛小姐，需要委託給您的工作還是挺多的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"不要轉移話題嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了啦，馬上就過來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"羅德島宿舍區\n調香師的宿舍"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"改建區這裡的規劃就交給你了，雖然我們有更多的地方種植花卉了，但能節省的空間還是要儘量節省。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"這一塊就給豆苗小姐做養殖場用吧，那些共生花卉的定時採摘也麻煩你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"旁邊那一塊，就作為我的新居所吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"用建造溫室時剩餘的材料就好，沒有必要特意採購。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"大概就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"娜娜，我來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"請進......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"東西已經都安排好了，具體需要我做什麼嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我想把具體的搭設任務都交給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"造大棚嗎？那我熟的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"還需要你幫忙聯繫羅德島的施工團隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"那我更熟了，農業區那邊負責改修的幹員我都認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"都交給我們吧，萊娜姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（要是真的能都交給你們就好了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"改建期間療養庭院會休業，我會負責原本庭院區域的花卉栽種和日常維護，還要為類似葛羅莉亞小姐這樣依賴香薰療法的幹員提供服務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"施工時限是一個月，我想應該能在二十五天左右完成改修。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"波登可，能麻煩你重複一下剛剛分派給你的任務嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"是的姐姐，我需要規劃改建區，給您的新宿舍和豆苗小姐的養殖場騰出空間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，然後呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"然後？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"使用什麼板材，花卉如何劃分，怎麼摘取豆苗小姐磐蟹上的花朵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"有考慮過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（看來波登可還沒想好呢。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（不能把她丟在這一個人幹活呢，還是要指點她一下。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（這次工期很緊，沒時間讓她慢慢摸索了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（假期......還是以後再說吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我只是以防萬一問一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"改建的時候我會一直待在庭院裡的，如果有什麼不明白的地方，可以來問我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，我也一點點把宿舍裡的東西搬過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"大概就是這些，大家有什麼問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"娜娜，我一直以為你只懂花，但我看你懂得好多呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"只有自己做過，才能明白這些事應該怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，庭院裡所有的東西最早都是你自己做的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"總有些事，別人幫不上手，只好自己來處理了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為姐姐是指揮人工作的類型。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"沒下地做過怎麼指揮別人呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"現在流的每滴汗水都是今後指導別人的經驗，加油幹吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你以後能學有所成，自己獨立工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"最好帶個學徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，我做不到吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"等以後有新的幹員分配到庭院，你就是前輩了，到時候，自然要你去教別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"我就能真正把工作交給你，放心做指揮啦~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"萊娜姐姐~~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的話，先把剛剛幾個問題的答案告訴我，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，唔，我再想想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"有些問題還是要自己搞懂哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"波登可","speakerId":"char_258_podego","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"別著急，慢慢來，今天還長著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"調香師","speakerId":"char_181_flower","isRemote":false,"text":"（好好學吧，波登可，你一定可以的。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_181_flower","aliases":["調香師"]},{"speakerId":"char_222_bpipe","aliases":["風笛"]},{"speakerId":"char_258_podego","aliases":["波登可"]},{"speakerId":"char_452_bstalk","aliases":["？？？","豆苗"]}]}
